298
00:08:38,970 --> 00:08:40,830
But that's a lab checking itself.

299
00:08:41,090 --> 00:08:42,770
So who checks the lab?

300
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:45,260
Outsiders, like those evaluators.

301
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,720
This fall, the leaders

302
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,680
of the biggest AI

303
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,120
companies promised to let

304
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,540
outside auditors in.

305
00:08:50,790 --> 00:08:51,620
Promised.

306
00:08:51,660 --> 00:08:52,680
Not required.

307
00:08:52,850 --> 00:08:53,850
Making it binding

308
00:08:53,890 --> 00:08:55,270
is up to lawmakers.

309
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:57,180
And the stop itself?

310
00:08:57,730 --> 00:08:58,870
Tao Lin was asked

311
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:00,180
whether his own lab

312
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:01,970
will pause before AI

313
00:09:02,010 --> 00:09:04,060
builds AI on its own:

314
00:09:04,510 --> 00:09:06,270
I do expect Anthropic

315
00:09:06,310 --> 00:09:09,110
to slow down or briefly pause.

316
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:10,760
Briefly.

317
00:09:10,830 --> 00:09:13,200
He wants more: every lab slowing

318
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,250
to about a quarter

319
00:09:14,290 --> 00:09:15,500
of today's pace.

320
00:09:15,830 --> 00:09:17,990
And cautious labs slowing alone,

321
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:20,720
he says, buy only a year or two.

322
00:09:20,970 --> 00:09:22,140
So the stop has to be

323
00:09:22,180 --> 00:09:23,650
agreed in advance.

324
00:09:23,970 --> 00:09:26,520
Here, even rivals sound alike.

325
00:09:26,770 --> 00:09:28,870
OpenAI's chief scientist wants

326
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:29,730
the labs' safety

327
00:09:29,770 --> 00:09:31,350
rules made mandatory.

328
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:33,090
Anthropic says the world should

329
00:09:33,130 --> 00:09:34,920
have the option to pause,

330
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,600
with rules set beforehand

331
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,460
and outsiders at the table.

332
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,100
That includes the people

333
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:41,270
you vote for.

334
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:42,380
Your question for them

335
00:09:42,420 --> 00:09:44,090
takes no expertise:

336
00:09:44,310 --> 00:09:45,550
who checks the labs,

337
00:09:45,590 --> 00:09:47,090
and who can call a stop?

338
00:09:47,340 --> 00:09:48,710
Ask it, and the last

339
00:09:48,750 --> 00:09:49,700
rung isn't left

340
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:50,960
to the companies racing

341
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,370
each other up the ladder.

342
00:09:52,550 --> 00:09:54,430
Machines now do the building.

343
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:56,570
People still do the deciding:

344
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:57,840
what gets built,

345
00:09:57,880 --> 00:10:00,030
who checks it, and when to stop.

346
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,990
So how close is AI

347
00:10:03,030 --> 00:10:04,870
to building its own successor?

348
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,860
Two rungs: taken.

349
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:08,510
The third: shared,

350
00:10:08,550 --> 00:10:10,460
and by the best-known forecast,

351
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:11,660
taken next year.

352
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,390
The last two: in human hands.

353
00:10:14,590 --> 00:10:16,250
And that forecast only holds

354
00:10:16,290 --> 00:10:18,810
if nobody chooses to slow down.

355
00:10:19,850 --> 00:10:20,530
When you turn off

356
00:10:20,570 --> 00:10:21,680
the light tonight,

357
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,780
the machines will go on building.

358
00:10:24,130 --> 00:10:25,760
You may be using one of the last

359
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:28,430
AI models designed by human minds.

360
00:10:28,650 --> 00:10:29,960
The next one may be able

361
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,900
to design its own successor.

362
00:10:32,150 --> 00:10:33,040
Whether it's allowed

363
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:35,340
to is still a human decision.

364
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,970
That's the last rung.

365
00:10:37,220 --> 00:10:38,620
And it's still ours.

366
00:10:39,730 --> 00:10:40,890
This channel exists

367
00:10:40,930 --> 00:10:42,320
so that superintelligence

368
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:44,420
arrives well for all of us.

369
00:10:44,550 --> 00:10:45,550
Want that too?

370
00:10:45,610 --> 00:10:46,610
Subscribe.

